<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani cotton yarn rates hold steady.</title>
<headline>Pakistani cotton yarn rates hold steady.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed steady on Wednesday as cotton prices remained stable in domestic markets, dealers said. One dealer said rates were likely to remain steady in the next few	  435</p>
<p>435</p>
<p>    Shafiq			 400	   400</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
